# Public API origin, no trailing slash. Vite inlines this at build time.
#
# Local `npm run dev`: put http://127.0.0.1:8080 in .env.development.local
#   (or leave empty and use the Vite /api proxy).
# Tunnel / phone / production build: leave empty (same-origin) in .env.production
#   so the SPA calls https://YOUR_HOST/api/… — never bake 127.0.0.1 into dist.
# On Vercel, if the API is on another host, set VITE_API_BASE there and redeploy.
VITE_API_BASE=
